  "_note": "62256 32K x 8 Static RAM. Pin table audited against Alliance AS6C62256 datasheet (rev 2.0, 2009). DIP-28 package. 15-bit address bus (A0-A14), 8-bit data bus (D0-D7). Control: CSB (pin 20, chip select active low), OEB (pin 22, output enable active low), WEB (pin 27, write enable active low). Pin-compatible with AT28C256 EEPROM (pin 20 = CEB on EEPROM). GND=pin 14, VCC=pin 28.",
